    {
      "id": 85409,
      "name": "Rabit",
      "username": "Rabit",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-12-25T14:44:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Easiest apprpoach is to read what the card says and follow that wording. For example, Hypersonic Assault (Tachyon's card) says \"Targets dealt damage this way cannot deal damage until the start of your next turn.\" If the target reduced the damage to 0 or is immune to damage, they didn't take damage, so they aren't affected by this effect of the card. If the card doesn't have text like this, it will still have an effect.</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:09:04.957Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 9175,
      "topic_slug": "throat-jab-hypersonic-assault",
