      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Easiest apprpoach is to read what the card says and follow that wording. For example, Hypersonic Assault (Tachyon&#39;s card) says &quot;Targets dealt damage this way cannot deal damage until the start of your next turn.&quot; If the target reduced the damage to 0 or is immune to damage, they didn&#39;t take damage, so they aren&#39;t affected by this effect of the card. If the card doesn&#39;t have text like this, it will still have an effect.</p>",
