      "raw": "<p>This is in the same camp as Nightmist not being able to redirect damage while in Mist Form.&nbsp; Since she is immune to damage, she cannot redirect it since she wouldn&#39;t be taking damage.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Though, in the end, some card texts will let you work around this rule (like Stun Bolt, as mentioned above).&nbsp; Wording is key here.</p>",
